 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Night sky throughout; geometric for «فإن العزة لله جميعا», a book for «في الكتاب» that leaves before the mockery. No motif on the hypocrites, the mockers or the Fire. STAGING v4: 137-139: a town at dusk; believers on one side, disbelievers on the other, and between them a small group of men (3, the hypocrites). They turn their backs on 137:5, face again on 137:7 and turn their backs again on 137:9 (believing then disbelieving, both tafsirs); the camera holds on them during the threat 138; on 139:2 they walk over to the disbelievers (taking them as allies instead of the believers); geometric on 139:13. 140: a sitting in a house; the mockers (3 men) speak on 140:13; the believers sitting with them stand up on 140:16 and walk away on 140:17 (not sitting with them, the ruling), leaving the stage on 140:19 before 140:23-33; the camera holds on the mockers during the warning. No book is shown near the mockery (book plate 140:5-8 only)."
 },
